    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olapolosani lang kitok Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.110.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 110.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore embae sapuk te kuna naaji naa ena: eikiaata doi iyiook olapolosani kitok oba neijia. Olotonita te tatene e Nkitoo e Shumata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olaisiaayiani le ine wueji sinyati o le ilo ng'obor osipa leme oltung'ani oitasheyie kake Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore olapolosani ake pooki netegeluaki meishooi nkishorot neitayu lasarri, naa keishaakino apa neeta sii ninye ele apolosani entoki naishooyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te naa kena kop etii, nemeaku hoo olapolosani, amu keetae naa lelo kulikae apolosak ooishooyo nkishorot anaa enajo nkitanapat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 25.40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neisiaai ninche nyaanyukie o loip le ine wueji sinyati te shumata; amu ore pee eaku keun Musa olng'obor, netuutaka Enkai ninye nejoki, “Toduaa taa ntobira pooki toki nturubare lelo sirat likintoduaaki to ldoinyio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore anaa enatiu, enoto ninye Kristo enkisiaayiare naikishiaan ele sotua oyau ninye, amu eitabayioki too nkisiligat naalusoo te nekua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu tene meeta apa ilo sotua ntiyot, naa anaata meetae ae nayaunyeki likae liaare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.31.31+JER.31.32+JER.31.33+JER.31.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 31.31-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu ntiyot etoduaa te ninche pee etejo: “Kepuonu nkolong'i, Olaitoriani ojo, naa kayooki aitayu osotua ng'ejuk o enkaji e Israel o enkaji e Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lemetiu anaa olapa sotua laitayio o loo menye enapa olong pee aibung ninche te nkaina ariku aitung'uaa enkop e Misiri; amu eitu ninche etoni ti atua osotua lai, naa ina pee eitu aitoki ashilaa ninche Olaitoriani ojo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nele osotua laitayu o enkaji e Israel te nelusoo nena olong'i, Olaitoriani ojo. Kapik nkitanapat aainei atua lukuny enye, naiger ninche ti atua iltauja lenye, naa kaaku Enkai enye, neaku ninche iltung'ana laainei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nemeitoki pooki ng'ae aiteng'en ole latia enye aashu eiteng'en pooki ng'ae olalashe lenye, ajoki, ‘Tayiolo Olaitoriani,’ amu kaayiolou pooki nanu, eiteru to loti te pooki o metabaiki olkitok te pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu katum kenya ake olng'ur ti alo ntorrok enye, nemaitoki ae kata adamu ng'ok enye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eimaki ninye osotua ng'ejuk neitaa musana ole nkiterata. Ore ilo omusanu aaku moruo netinyikaka enkiishata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
